---
description: PRs include a Test plan with boxes checked for work already done
alwaysApply: true
---

# Pull requests

- Before opening (or updating) a PR, **actually run** the verification that belongs
  in the Test plan: `make check`, relevant smokes, and local Docker when the change
  touches the image/runtime path. Fix failures before opening.
- Keep a `## Test plan` section with checkboxes.
- **Check** every box for work you already completed in this session.
- Leave a box **unchecked** only when a human must still do something important
  (e.g. production deploy, secret rotation, manual product sign-off you cannot do).
- Do not dump an unchecked TODO list of work the agent was supposed to do.
